        "Peel the peaches, apples, and pears, and chop them up in very tiny pieces. Set aside.",
        "Fry the ground meat in a pan with garlic and salt (to taste) over low heat in a spoonful of oil. Ground meat is done at 160°F (71°C) inside.",
        "When the meat is cooked, add the fruit and the raisins, and fry for about 4 minutes. Let cool.",
        "Put the poblano peppers on the stove and let them get toasted.",
        "After toasting them put the peppers in water and cut them on one of the long sides.",
        "Wash away the veins and the dark toasted spots on them.",
