        "Add the finely chopped onion and minced garlic.",
        "Sauté until the onion becomes translucent and fragrant.",
        "Add the ground cumin, ground paprika, ground cayenne pepper, ground coriander, and ground cinnamon.",
        "Stir well to combine and let the spices toast for a minute to release their flavors.",
        "Add the diced tomatoes (including the juice) to the tagine or skillet.",
